  goldReward: 500
  expReward: 100
  offerDialogue:
    name: Vance
    sentences:
    - People can already get between them, but the current route takes them all the
      way around.
    - A direct crossing here would create a better connection between the two areas.
    - This crossing is a little different from the last one you worked on.
    - As weight moves across the bridge, its different parts will have to work together
      to carry it.
    - Keep an eye on how those parts respond when you test your design.
    - If you're interested, I can give you the contract.
  continueOfferDialogue:
    name: Vance
    sentences: []
  reminderDialogue:
    name: Vance
    sentences:
    - Take your time with the design.
    - Pay attention to how the different parts of the bridge respond when it's under
      load.
  finishedContractDialogue:
    name: Vance
    sentences:
    - That should make traveling between the two areas much easier.
    - It's good to finally have a direct connection between them.
